  "description": "The WIDE 2.0 is our Big Gravel frame, for anything from tough races to endless adventures. The geometry of the WIDE 2.0 is designed to be lively and agile - typical OPEN - with 45-66mm tires. The rider position is a bit more relaxed than on the UP|UPPER 2.0.\nThe ultralight OPEN BAR cockpit offers 15mm of micro-stem length adjustment in 5mm steps, while the size-specific frame design ensure the best experience regardless of rider height. The WIDE 2.0 comes with our completely new U-Turn AC/DC+ fork, combining an aero profile with our patented cargo slots. The CHASSIS includes frame, fork, headset, seatpost and integrated handlebar/stem. During check-out you can specify the handlebar size you want in the \"Additional Information\" field. If you're not sure, simply write \"need help with frame/handlebar sizing\" and we'll contact you.",
